# Key Takeaways

- Parsing is the foundation of effective threat detection.
- Always validate telemetry before writing KQL detections.
- Inspect raw logs to understand their structure.
- Extract commonly used fields early to simplify later analysis.
- Well-parsed data improves hunting, investigation, and incident response.
